                                "sense_id": "cfb1ddb4-ecfa-3334-a615-1cae7089c933",
                                "text": "[…] her novel illuminates the general situation facing all children of postcolonial immigrants across the West, from the banlieue of France to the Islamic neighborhoods of New York to the Hispanic ghettos of Los Angeles."
